{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794351002700,"sessionID":"ses_e386d783fffeaDLoAZQNXyWTbi","part":{"id":"prt_1c7a7742e001j74NjAge1fbd63","messageID":"msg_1c7a73156001kDRQy4UDYBbfmJ","sessionID":"ses_e386d783fffeaDLoAZQNXyWTbi","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794351002700,"sessionID":"ses_e386d783fffeaDLoAZQNXyWTbi","part":{"id":"prt_1c7a77431001NAg9VQ4x7NT0O3","messageID":"msg_1c7a73156001kDRQy4UDYBbfmJ","sessionID":"ses_e386d783fffeaDLoAZQNXyWTbi","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a warehouse inventory app: Flask (Python 3.13) JSON API under `/api` plus a React/TypeScript (Vite, Tailwind) frontend served by the backend; SQLite data in `./data`; Docker image on port 8000.\n- Public reads; signed-in users (Bearer token) manage items and record stock movements; items at/below reorder level flagged `low_stock`; movements can never take quantity below 0.\n\n## Important Details\n- Layout: `backend/` (entry `backend/app.py`, served gunicorn `app:app`), `frontend/` (Vite build → `frontend/dist`), `Dockerfile` at workspace root, deps pinned via `backend/requirements.lock` and `frontend/package-lock.json`.\n- API contract: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` → `{\"token\": ...}` (200), `GET /api/items` (params `q`, `location`, `low_stock`, `page`, `page_size`; returns `{items, total, page, page_size}`, sorted by name), `POST/GET/PUT/DELETE /api/items/{id}` (PUT replaces `name`, `sku`, `location`, `reorder_level`, leaves quantity), `GET/POST /api/items/{id}/movements` (POST body `delta` (+/−), `reason`; returns `{items: [...]}` newest first). Errors return `{\"error\": msg}`. `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`.\n- Item shape: `id, name, sku, location, quantity, reorder_level, low_stock`. Movement shape: `id, item_id, delta, reason, quantity_after, created_at, username`.\n- Decisions: tokens via `itsdangerous.URLSafeSerializer` with secret persisted at `data/secret_key`; passwords via `werkzeug.security` hashes; SQLite tables `users`, `items` (UNIQUE sku), `movements` (cascade-deleted manually); duplicate sku → 409 with message mentioning `sku`; movement below zero → 400, nothing changes; `low_stock = quantity <= reorder_level`.\n- Frontend deps pinned exactly: react 19.3.1, react-dom 19.3.1, react-router-dom 7.18.5, tailwindcss 4.3.5, @tailwindcss/vite 4.3.5, typescript 7.0.2, vite 8.3.5, @vitejs/plugin-react 6.2.1, @types/react 19.3.0, @types/react-dom 19.3.0. `npm run build` = `tsc --noEmit && vite build`. `jsdom` installed with `--no-save` (must NOT be added to package.json/lockfile).\n- Local test venv at `/workspace/.venv` (workspace `/tmp/opencode` not writable by user `node`).\n- Style: Tailwind utility classes only; single Tailwind entry `frontend/src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Backend `backend/app.py` rewritten: full API (auth, items, movements), SQLite schema init, validation helpers, `login_required`, frontend static/SPA fallback with JSON 404 for unknown `/api/*` routes.\n- Backend API smoke suite `/workspace/smoke_api.py` (Flask test client): 76/76 checks pass.\n- Frontend deps installed, `tsconfig.json`, `vite.config.ts` (react + tailwind plugins, `/api` proxy), `src/index.css`, `src/types.ts`, `src/api.ts` (fetch wrapper, `ApiError`, localStorage token/username, `auth-changed` event), `src/auth.tsx` (AuthProvider/useAuth), `src/ui.tsx` (shared classes/badges/alerts).\n- Pages written: `src/pages/AuthPage.tsx`, `src/pages/ItemsPage.tsx` (search/location/low-stock/paging, PAGE_SIZE=10), `src/pages/ItemPage.tsx` (details, movements table, Receive/Take out `MovementForm`, delete confirm), `src/pages/ItemFormPage.tsx` (add/edit with API error display); `src/App.tsx` routes `/`, `/account`, `/items/new`, `/items/:id`, `/items/:id/edit`.\n- `frontend/index.html` title → \"Warehouse Inventory\"; `frontend/package.json` pinned, lockfile in sync (`npm ci --dry-run` ok).\n- `npm run build` succeeds: `dist/assets/index-BPLR32_w.js`, `dist/assets/index-Dxi1oEWF.css`.\n- HTTP e2e `/workspace/smoke_http.py` against gunicorn on :8000: all pass (health, SPA fallback, assets, auth, items, movements, low-stock). Data persistence verified across gunicorn restart.\n\n### Active\n- jsdom render smoke test `/workspace/frontend/smoke_render.mjs` just ran and failed: executing the production bundle `dist/assets/index-BPLR32_w.js` in jsdom threw (error output was the minified bundle dump, truncated). Likely missing jsdom globals (e.g. `fetch`/`window.matchMedia`/module-load timing) or a React runtime error — needs diagnosis/fix of the harness (or abandoning jsdom for a curl/HTML-based check).\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Diagnose the `node smoke_render.mjs` failure (capture only the error message, not the bundle source; fix missing jsdom globals or skip jsdom and verify UI another way), then re-run it.\n2. Re-run `npm run build`, `smoke_api.py`, `smoke_http.py` as a final regression, clean up temporary files (`smoke_api.py`, `smoke_http.py`, `smoke_server.log`, `smoke_gunicorn.pid`, `frontend/smoke_render.mjs`, jsdom `--no-save` install, local `data/`), stop the gunicorn daemon (`kill $(cat /workspace/smoke_gunicorn.pid)`), and confirm Dockerfile build assumptions hold.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + static frontend serving (rewritten, working).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0 (+ pinned transitive lock).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/`: `main.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `auth.tsx`, `api.ts`, `types.ts`, `ui.tsx`, `index.css`, `pages/{AuthPage,ItemsPage,ItemPage,ItemFormPage}.tsx`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`, `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`, `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/index.html`.\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: build/run contract (port 8000, `./data`, `npm ci`, pip constraints).\n- Temporary test artifacts to delete before finishing: `/workspace/smoke_api.py`, `/workspace/smoke_http.py`, `/workspace/frontend/smoke_render.mjs`, `/workspace/smoke_server.log`, `/workspace/smoke_gunicorn.pid`.","time":{"start":1794351002673,"end":1794351002677}}}
